WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.075
Unit five. Brushing Teeth!

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.765
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.815 --> 00:00:11.458
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.508 --> 00:00:15.154
Today we learn about Brushing Teeth. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:19.601
Toothbrush. Say it with me. Toothbrush!

6
00:00:23.101 --> 00:00:26.734
Toothpaste. Say it with me. Toothpaste!

7
00:00:30.257 --> 00:00:33.324
Teeth. Say it with me. Teeth!

8
00:00:36.825 --> 00:00:40.409
Smile. Say it with me. Smile!

9
00:00:43.911 --> 00:00:47.194
Morning. Say it with me. Morning!

10
00:00:50.677 --> 00:00:54.344
Evening. Say it with me. Evening!

11
00:00:57.884 --> 00:01:01.418
Cavity. Say it with me. Cavity!

12
00:01:04.896 --> 00:01:08.396
Dentist. Say it with me. Dentist!

13
00:01:11.896 --> 00:01:21.758
I brush my teeth with a toothbrush and toothpaste every morning and evening. Brushing keeps my teeth strong and prevents a cavity. I visit the dentist to check my smile.

14
00:01:21.808 --> 00:01:23.025
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:29.654
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.704 --> 00:01:30.854
Teeth!

17
00:01:31.618 --> 00:01:36.742
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:36.792 --> 00:01:37.942
Cavity!

19
00:01:38.785 --> 00:01:44.698
Did you know? You should change your toothbrush every three months to keep it working well!

20
00:01:44.748 --> 00:01:46.684
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.472 --> 00:01:55.551
Think and answer. How many times a day should you brush your teeth?

22
00:01:55.601 --> 00:01:56.751
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.971 --> 00:02:02.836
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.886 --> 00:02:05.526
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

